0:06:00.00 --> 0:07:45.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: An earthquake hits and flattens a forest. A bear is found dead.)

0:12:54.77 --> 0:12:55.45
sex word 1 (naked, AI flag)

0:26:00.00 --> 0:26:10.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A house crashes into flood waters.)

0:31:10.00 --> 0:31:15.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A man is slapped.)

0:38:30.00 --> 0:39:50.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Paddington chases a man, almost runs into a bus then crashes and trips him.)

0:46:30.00 --> 0:47:10.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A man is tied upside town and tortured. He is then dropped in the river.)

1:00:30.00 --> 1:01:15.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A woman enters a house, shoots darts at Paddington and deploys a gas grenade.)

1:01:40.00 --> 1:02:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: An oven explodes and knocks a woman out.)

1:13:30.00 --> 1:14:00.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Paddington gets hit by a dart and falls down the stairs.)

1:14:15.00 --> 1:14:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A woman prepares to kill and stuff Paddington. We see some severed eyeballs.)

1:15:20.00 --> 1:15:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: An explosive goes off.)

1:16:30.00 --> 1:16:50.00
sex 1 (SceneRadar: A couple share a long kiss.)

1:18:00.00 --> 1:18:15.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A man loses footing while walking on a ledge, but manages to climb back.)

1:19:10.00 --> 1:21:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A woman chases Paddington and shoots darts. Paddington escapes to a vent and starts climbing out. The woman sets the vent on fire. Paddington climbs out - but loses his grip and starts falling down. He gets grabbed by his family and is pulled to safety.)

1:23:00.00 --> 1:23:45.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Paddington throws a sandwich in the air. A swarm of pigeons fly at a woman standing on the roof and make her lose footing. She trips and falls down.)
